  "caption": "Crucially, our sheets preserve cell-type contradictions. In astrocytes, NHE6 drops ~45%, and restoring it rescues LRP1. Yet in neurons, inhibiting NHE6 restores surface ApoER2, and in knock-in slices, deleting NHE6 restores Reelin-enhanced LTP. Meanwhile, H2 holds 0 Tier 1 papers, and 4 paywalled entries stay abstract-only.",
